        "title": "See it if....",
        "text": "Go here if you've prepared yourself for the experience. I had an excellent guide who pretty well explained enough. I had been to Varanasi four times and thought that was enough preparation. It was not. Perhaps it was the time of year (Nov. 2009) and just a day after a special observance when crowds come leaving so much behind, but it felt very filthy. I did enjoy getting my fill of the Sadhus sitting/standing around. Sometimes it feels like they've dressed up for Halloween in order to earn money from tourists. I was willing to pay. Didn't care for the dogs, but there were no issues.",
